Here is the code in C to find the greatest common divisor (GCD) of two numbers:

```c
#include <stdio.h>

int gcd(int a, int b) {
    while (a != b) {
        if (a > b) {
            a = a - b;
        } else {
            b = b - a;
        }
    }
    return a;
}

